         together (turbo group removed in v0.18.1.0, user test 2026-10-15: sounded bad in every variant).
         needsSuspension="true": the sound uses the SUSPENSION modifier (Suspensions:getSuspensionModfier,
         dataS.gar Suspensions.lua:267, reads spec_suspensions without a nil check), so it is only attached to vehicles
         with that specialization; without suspension nodes it stays silent. Start volumes = values of the source
         vehicles, to be calibrated in a hearing test. v0.18.1.0 (user test 2026-10-15): rattle and rumble 1.5x, before
         attacherClanks 1.5 (template), indoorCabinRumble / indoorCabinOldVehicle 9, JD 9RX 10 -->
